   "setup": [
    "1243 vulnerable vs 459 secure patches, written by 26 agent runs (Claude, Gemini, GLM, Kimi, Qwen with SWE-agent, OpenHands, CLIs). Both kinds pass the task's functional tests; vulnerable ones fail the hidden CVE security test. Identical patches kept once; patches over 60k characters left out.",
